    ValueError: The two structures don't have the same nested structure

    >>> tf.nest.assert_same_structure(
    ...       collections.namedtuple('bar', 'a b')(1, 2),
    ...       collections.namedtuple('foo', 'a b')(2, 3))
    Traceback (most recent call last):
